# Force LF line endings for all text files regardless of platform, so tools
# like gofmt (which expect LF) don't flag files as "not formatted" purely
# because a Windows checkout converted them to CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.go text eol=lf
go.mod text eol=lf
go.sum text eol=lf

# Binary/generated assets should never be touched by line-ending normalization.
*.png binary
*.dmp binary
